# NOTE: node_modules is intentionally NOT ignored here. It was vendored
# (copied from already-installed packages) rather than npm-installed,
# because this environment has no package-registry network access — see
# README.md "About this environment". Once you have normal npm access,
# feel free to delete node_modules, add it to .gitignore, and run
# `npm install` for a standard setup instead.
